## 最终层级 301.1

\[
\boxed{
\begin{aligned}
\text{SCM}
&\xrightarrow{\operatorname{Obs}}
Z_{\mathrm{obs}}\\
&\xrightarrow{\text{new interventions}}
Z_{\mathrm{int}}\\
&\xrightarrow{\text{shared exogenous coupling}}
Z_{\mathrm{cf}}\\
&\xrightarrow{\text{task quotient}}
Z_T.
